  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Simple interest: finding the rate and the time (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>{@nm@} lent a friend Ksh \( {@P0@} \). After \( {@T0@} \) years the friend paid back a total of Ksh \( {@A0@} \), which included simple interest.</p>
<p>(a) How much interest was paid?</p>
<div>Interest \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Find the rate of simple interest per annum.</p>
<div>\( R = \) [[input:ans2]] \( \% \) [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<p>(c) At the same rate, how many years would it take for Ksh \( {@P0@} \) to earn Ksh \( {@I2@} \) in interest?</p>
<div>\( T = \) [[input:ans3]] years [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>(a)</strong> \( I = \text{Amount} - P = {@A0@} - {@P0@} = {@si@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> Make \( R \) the subject of \( I = \dfrac{PRT}{100} \):</p>
\[ R = \frac{100 \times I}{P \times T} = \frac{100 \times {@si@}}{ {@P0@} \times {@T0@} } = {@rd(R0)@}\%. \]
<p><strong>(c)</strong> Make \( T \) the subject:</p>
\[ T = \frac{100 \times I}{P \times R} = \frac{100 \times {@I2@}}{ {@P0@} \times {@rd(R0)@} } = {@rd(T2)@} \text{ years}. \]]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>3</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025010100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text><![CDATA[nm : rand(["Esther", "Kelvin", "Wanjiru", "Otieno", "Achieng", "Kiprono", "Amina", "Mutua"]);
rd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else float(v);
P0 : rand([40000, 80000, 120000, 200000, 300000, 500000]);
/* Avoid R*T*(T-1) = 100, where "used the amount" and "did not divide by T" coincide. */
rt : rand(sublist(create_list([u, w], u, [5/2, 3, 4, 5, 11/2, 6, 15/2, 8], w, [2, 3, 4, 5]),
                  lambda([z], is(z[1]*z[2]*(z[2] - 1) # 100))));
R0 : rt[1];
T0 : rt[2];
si : P0*R0*T0/100;
A0 : P0 + si;
T2 : rand_with_prohib(2, 8, [T0]);
I2 : P0*R0*T2/100;
w_amt   : 100*A0/(P0*T0);                /* used the amount instead of the interest */
w_total : 100*si/P0;                     /* total % for the whole period (did not divide by T) */
w_no100 : si/(P0*T0);                    /* forgot the 100 */]]></text>
    </questionvariables>
